      "changes": "New implementation from confirmed level-experience decisions on 2026-10-15: shared account transaction contract, contribution deduplication, warning/grace/demotion, historical peak, achievement milestones and host-driven UI. Composes existing foundation tokens, theme, buttons, state and dialog modules; no product level algorithm copied. Formula-driven doubling milestones, ordinary-to-special artwork and independent commemorative/contribution definitions share the series source entry. Pure award preparation preserves provenance and deduplicates ownership; trusted host owns eligibility and atomic persistence. Current artwork and Chinese uppercase ordinals accepted by user and enabled for spatial local level awards; specific independent event definitions remain under review. Additive owned-medal strip/detail components and pure owned-account wear selection, user-authorized on 2026-10-15. Product hosts persist optional wear preference and compose existing action buttons; no cloud sync or independent award eligibility added."
